   "text": "Info line (engine text): The value gap (Requested - Confirmed back-allocated) is priced in the local currency of the legal entity and converted to EUR with\nthe rate of that month (S-30x). A planning-model price wins over its Product Class price. Without a price the value gap is blank and counted.",
   "originalText": "Info line (engine text): The value gap (Requested - Confirmed back-allocated) is priced in the local currency of the legal entity and converted to EUR with\nthe rate of that month (S-30x). A planning-model price wins over its Product Class price. Without a price the value gap is blank and counted.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
